{"unit_id":"yuanstarstar__dsh-maid#card-zh","repo":"yuanstarstar/dsh-maid","commit":"c50138ecd75c13465762c498fcb0a86cc0a36970","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-maid 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的女仆角色扮演插件。它将当前角色设定注入 Agent 的系统提示词，并为每个角色注册可在新建对话时选择的模式。用户可以查看、导入或生成角色卡，切换和退出角色模式，也能导出或删除角色；角色库通过 DSH 存储服务持久化。设置页提供基本操作说明。生成角色卡会调用 DSH 当前默认模型；导入角色则可直接使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:109-132","index.js:146-181","index.js:446-513","client.js:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"yuanstarstar__dsh-maid#card-en","repo":"yuanstarstar/dsh-maid","commit":"c50138ecd75c13465762c498fcb0a86cc0a36970","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-maid adds maid roleplay to DSH web. It injects the active persona into the agent prompt and registers session presets. Users can list, import, generate, switch, export, or delete character cards; DSH storage persists them. Generation uses the default model.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:109-132","index.js:146-181","index.js:446-513","client.js:1-30"]}
