{"unit_id":"yuanstarstar__dsh-maid#feature-1","repo":"yuanstarstar/dsh-maid","commit":"c50138ecd75c13465762c498fcb0a86cc0a36970","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-maid 的功能「角色提示词注入」：把当前角色的身份、性格、说话方式和规则加入 Agent 系统提示词。导入、生成或切换角色后即可按该人设对话；清空当前角色会恢复普通模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:109-132","index.js:446-451"]}
{"unit_id":"yuanstarstar__dsh-maid#feature-2","repo":"yuanstarstar/dsh-maid","commit":"c50138ecd75c13465762c498fcb0a86cc0a36970","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-maid 的功能「角色卡管理」：可列出角色，导入 JSON 卡片、按描述生成角色、切换或退出角色、导出完整 JSON，以及删除角色。管理通过 Agent 工具调用完成，导入和生成后会立即激活角色。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:392-444","index.js:454-513"]}
{"unit_id":"yuanstarstar__dsh-maid#feature-3","repo":"yuanstarstar/dsh-maid","commit":"c50138ecd75c13465762c498fcb0a86cc0a36970","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-maid 的功能「会话模式选择」：为保存的每个角色注册一个 DSH Agent preset，用户可在新建对话的模式选择器中挑选角色；设置页也展示进入、退出模式和管理角色卡的说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:332-378","client.js:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"yuanstarstar__dsh-maid#caveat-1","repo":"yuanstarstar/dsh-maid","commit":"c50138ecd75c13465762c498fcb0a86cc0a36970","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-maid 使用前须知：按提示生成角色卡需要 DSH 已配置默认模型；未选择 provider 或 model 时生成会失败，导入已有 JSON 角色卡不依赖此生成流程。（见 index.js:146-151）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:146-151"]}
